    "2027-03-01": "Open Event (Wed 3rd Mar)", "2027-03-08": "Open Event (Wed 10th Mar). Wellbeing Day (Thurs 11th Mar)", "2027-03-22": "Term ends (Thurs 25th Mar). Bank holiday (Fri 26th Mar)", "2027-05-03": "Bank holiday (Mon 3rd May)",
